			<div class="content" id="post-content-3094130">
									

<p>Thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/desperadozod" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2026277); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2026277&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1499512574" alt="DesperadoZod" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2026277)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/desperadozod" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2026277); return false;">DesperadoZod</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mortos" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1705184); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1705184&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1499512574" alt="Mortos" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1705184)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mortos" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1705184); return false;">Mortos</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chubert" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(502908); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=502908&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1499512574" alt="Chubert" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=502908)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chubert" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(502908); return false;">Chubert</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tufto" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2826145); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2826145&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1499512574" alt="Tufto" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2826145)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tufto" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2826145); return false;">Tufto</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/flawed" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3089916); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3089916&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1499512574" alt="Flawed" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3089916)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/flawed" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3089916); return false;">Flawed</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/bittermixin" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3085453); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3085453&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1499512574" alt="bittermixin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3085453)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/bittermixin" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3085453); return false;">bittermixin</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/orionbasher" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1432840); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1432840&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1499512574" alt="Orionbasher" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1432840)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/orionbasher" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1432840); return false;">Orionbasher</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/shio" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(515493); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=515493&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1499512574" alt="Shio" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=515493)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/shio" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(515493); return false;">Shio</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mlister" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3027978); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3027978&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1499512574" alt="mlister" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3027978)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mlister" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3027978); return false;">mlister</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nekromykon" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3188600); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3188600&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1499512574" alt="Nekromykon" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3188600)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nekromykon" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3188600); return false;">Nekromykon</a></span> and many others who read and gave this feedback when it was a draft.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Wow,&nbsp;this&nbsp;is&nbsp;pretty&nbsp;similar&nbsp;to&nbsp;SCP-231-J</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Although I can see the similarities between the two articles, they have different objectives. SCP-231-J is mainly centered around parodying 231 and showing how a small loan can fuck up the Foundation real badly. 8851-J is centered around parodying containment procedures and showing what happens when the Foundation has no money.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Wow,&nbsp;this&nbsp;is&nbsp;pretty&nbsp;similar&nbsp;to&nbsp;SCP-1150-J</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Well kinda, but again, the focus is different. Quoting <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gene-r" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(634139); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=634139&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1499512574" alt="Gene R" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=634139)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gene-r" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(634139); return false;">Gene R</a></span>: &quot;It's a joke on bureaucracy, poor management, irresponsibility and corruption in general.&quot; It's a big &quot;fuck you&quot; from the Russian site to companies which mistreat them after the collapse of the USSR. 8851-J is centered around the Foundation and other organizations having no money to begin with.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>

