<p>The similarities to 231-J and 1150-J <em>are</em> part of the problem, I think- right off the bat you're pitting yourself against both Russian gallows humor and DaveYouFool on his A-game. (I'm also reminded of the <a href="/cimmerian-kaktus-proposal">Cimmerian-Kaktus Proposal</a> for 001-J.) Those together set a high bar to match. It's not impossible, but it'll take a lot of polishing to get there.</p>

